{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Outlaw's Contract Board: the neutral board in Ratchet gives the shared call board quests and the Legion quest",
  "contract": "The Outlaw's Contract Board (gameobject 1804480) stands in Ratchet and serves both factions. It gives every quest that the Hero's Call Board (402000) and the Warchief's Command Board (402001) both give, plus the High-Risk quest 982019 For The Legion: A Heap of..., which no faction board gives. A level-60 Orc picks PvE Quests and finds the shared PvE daily 18017 Culling the Felpaw. A level-70 Human without the High-Risk ruleset aura (1004019) cannot take 982019; with the aura the board adds the High-Risk category, which lists 982019 and the shared Karazhan quest 420460 but not the Alliance-only daily 980019 of the Hero's Call Board. Accepting 982019 from the board adds it to the log.",
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
